WEBVTT

00:00:01.810 --> 00:00:05.730
Is it true that you’re transferring to the Medical Department?

00:00:05.730 --> 00:00:08.960
Yes. I’m transferring this April.

00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:11.590
What? I never heard about this!

00:00:11.590 --> 00:00:13.590
I’m sorry for keeping this from you.

00:00:14.710 --> 00:00:16.590
It’s just that I’ve been thinking...

00:00:16.590 --> 00:00:20.810
...about what I really want to do, and whether I really have no dreams.

00:00:20.810 --> 00:00:25.400
Naoki, I want you to be my successor.

00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:27.480
I’m going to become a doctor.

00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:30.770
I’m not going to succeed your company. I’ve already made up my mind.

00:00:31.620 --> 00:00:32.870
Naoki!

00:00:38.670 --> 00:00:39.530
Dad!

00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:42.040
Dad! What’s wrong?!

00:00:42.730 --> 00:00:44.040
My chest...

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:44.910
Papa!

00:00:45.610 --> 00:00:47.280
What’s wrong? Hang in there!

00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:48.450
Papa!

00:00:48.910 --> 00:00:50.670
Kotoko! The ambulance!

00:00:51.260 --> 00:00:52.780
Right!

00:01:16.810 --> 00:01:19.010
Oba-sama. Irie-kun.

00:01:19.010 --> 00:01:23.490
Here, I bought some food and stuff that I thought might be good.

00:01:23.490 --> 00:01:25.690
Thank you, Kotoko-chan.

00:01:25.690 --> 00:01:26.700
That’s very helpful.

00:01:26.700 --> 00:01:28.230
Excuse me.

00:01:30.200 --> 00:01:32.210
Doctor, how’s my father?

00:01:32.210 --> 00:01:34.900
We’ll be conducting
more detailed tests tomorrow.

00:01:34.900 --> 00:01:37.210
However, I suspect that it was a heart attack.

00:01:37.740 --> 00:01:41.220
Based on the test results, he may need surgery.

00:01:41.220 --> 00:01:42.860
Surgery?

00:01:42.860 --> 00:01:45.210
A coronary bypass?

00:01:45.210 --> 00:01:47.180
You’re very well informed.

00:01:47.180 --> 00:01:51.210
Well, we can only make a decision after we see the results.

00:01:51.210 --> 00:01:53.730
Whatever it is, he needs rest right now.

00:01:54.240 --> 00:01:57.500
We’ll be keeping him here for a while.

00:01:57.500 --> 00:01:59.990
Thank you very much.

00:03:42.360 --> 00:03:43.610
Oba-sama.

00:03:44.370 --> 00:03:47.670
I’m worried about Yuuki-kun, so I’m going to go back.

00:03:47.670 --> 00:03:49.450
Me too. I’ll be going to my shop.

00:03:50.400 --> 00:03:54.460
Kotoko-chan, thank you.
And Aihara-san, sorry for the trouble.

00:03:54.460 --> 00:03:57.050
Oba-sama, please get some rest too.

00:03:57.050 --> 00:03:58.210
I will.

00:03:58.660 --> 00:04:00.750
You can go home too, Onii-chan.

00:04:00.750 --> 00:04:03.710
Okay. I’ll come tomorrow morning to switch with you.

00:04:05.410 --> 00:04:06.670
Onii-chan...

00:04:07.460 --> 00:04:11.060
Let’s put off talking about your future until after Papa gets better, okay?

00:04:11.060 --> 00:04:13.560
Yeah. I know.

00:04:23.080 --> 00:04:24.450
Irie-kun?

00:04:26.540 --> 00:04:29.040
What’s wrong?
You didn’t even turn on the lights.

00:04:29.980 --> 00:04:31.690
I was just thinking.

00:04:31.690 --> 00:04:34.150
You must be worried about your father...

00:04:35.670 --> 00:04:41.170
Is there anything I can...? I guess not...

00:04:42.160 --> 00:04:46.180
I believe my father’s condition was caused by stress and anxiety.

00:04:46.180 --> 00:04:49.400
My father’s company is going through hard times.

00:04:49.400 --> 00:04:51.610
He’s solely responsible for the company,

00:04:51.610 --> 00:04:54.340
...and it’s because I told him then that I wouldn’t succeed him..

00:04:54.340 --> 00:04:56.190
...and instead wanted to become a doctor that...

00:04:56.190 --> 00:04:59.480
But... that’s...

00:05:00.170 --> 00:05:02.740
The best way to help my father recover...

00:05:03.650 --> 00:05:05.700
...is to succeed the company.

00:05:05.700 --> 00:05:07.070
How could you?

00:05:07.070 --> 00:05:10.160
What about your dreams of becoming a doctor?

00:05:10.670 --> 00:05:13.020
It’s a dream that has barely taken off.

00:05:13.020 --> 00:05:16.660
But, didn’t you study your heart out?

00:05:16.660 --> 00:05:21.430
And you said that you’d help Non-chan get well too!

00:05:23.060 --> 00:05:23.920
Irie-kun...

00:05:26.840 --> 00:05:30.800
Irie-kun looked so lonely from behind.

00:05:30.800 --> 00:05:32.240
I did it without thinking.

00:05:33.220 --> 00:05:38.310
But, Irie-kun didn’t push away my arms.

00:05:46.200 --> 00:05:47.420
Good afternoon!

00:05:47.420 --> 00:05:48.660
Welcome!

00:05:48.660 --> 00:05:50.170
Oh, Kotoko-san.

00:05:50.170 --> 00:05:52.260
Oh, you’re here, Kotoko.

00:05:52.870 --> 00:05:54.260
How’s Iri-chan doing?

00:05:54.260 --> 00:05:56.280
I’m going there again after this.

00:05:56.280 --> 00:05:59.260
But, he looked much better than when I saw him yesterday.

00:05:59.850 --> 00:06:01.480
That’s good to hear.

00:06:01.480 --> 00:06:03.900
He said that he was exhausted
from all the tests.

00:06:03.900 --> 00:06:04.930
Really?

00:06:04.930 --> 00:06:07.850
Say, Dad, where’s Kin-chan?

00:06:07.850 --> 00:06:10.430
He invited me over today.

00:06:10.430 --> 00:06:12.930
Ah, he’s in the kitchen.

00:06:15.050 --> 00:06:17.820
Kinnosuke is much more skillful than he looks.

00:06:17.820 --> 00:06:20.020
He tries his hardest after all.

00:06:20.810 --> 00:06:24.490
I’ve never seen Kin-chan look so serious before.

00:06:24.490 --> 00:06:27.200
He doesn’t even notice that I’m here.

00:06:28.400 --> 00:06:32.760
Actually, today will be his first day cooking for patrons.

00:06:36.850 --> 00:06:38.710
Wow! This looks great!

00:06:38.710 --> 00:06:40.640
Please try it, Kotoko.

00:06:40.640 --> 00:06:43.130
Okay, thanks for the meal.

00:06:46.520 --> 00:06:48.380
So, how is it?

00:06:48.380 --> 00:06:50.050
It’s delicious!

00:06:50.050 --> 00:06:51.380
Really?

00:06:53.460 --> 00:06:56.080
It’s really delicious!

00:06:56.080 --> 00:06:57.320
Just like a pro.

00:06:57.320 --> 00:06:59.530
Actually...

00:06:59.530 --> 00:07:05.360
When I was first asked to cook, I wanted you to be the first one to try it.

00:07:05.360 --> 00:07:06.730
Kin-chan...

00:07:08.850 --> 00:07:10.600
Oops. Sorry about that.

00:07:10.600 --> 00:07:12.570
Would you like me to make you more of anything?

00:07:12.570 --> 00:07:13.630
These ones then.

00:07:13.630 --> 00:07:15.950
Right! Eat up!

00:07:23.920 --> 00:07:25.670
There are even more now!

00:07:25.670 --> 00:07:27.770
We’re gonna be suffocated.

00:07:27.770 --> 00:07:29.560
Well, it can’t be helped.

00:07:29.560 --> 00:07:32.760
The people related to the company just keep on sending stuff.

00:07:32.760 --> 00:07:36.680
I’ve been worrying the people in the company after all.

00:07:37.860 --> 00:07:39.420
Excuse us.

00:07:39.420 --> 00:07:41.920
President, how are you feeling?

00:07:41.920 --> 00:07:43.780
Sorry about this, Kimura-kun.

00:07:43.780 --> 00:07:46.120
The company is already
in enough trouble as it is.

00:07:46.120 --> 00:07:48.820
Not at all. It’s beyond your control, right?

00:07:48.820 --> 00:07:50.110
Excuse me, President.

00:07:50.110 --> 00:07:54.050
This may not be the best time, but who will take over the development of the new product?

00:07:54.050 --> 00:07:56.330
Yeah, that’s a good question.

00:07:56.330 --> 00:07:58.420
Please ask Murakami-kun to handle it then.

00:07:58.420 --> 00:08:01.370
Murakami is busy working on another project.

00:08:01.370 --> 00:08:03.150
He’s away in Osaka.

00:08:03.150 --> 00:08:04.520
I see.

00:08:04.520 --> 00:08:06.030
What about Yoshinaga-kun?

00:08:06.030 --> 00:08:07.780
Yoshinaga should do.

00:08:07.780 --> 00:08:09.430
Then, Yoshinaga will take over.

00:08:09.430 --> 00:08:12.440
Also, the matter with the sponsorship contract.

00:08:12.440 --> 00:08:16.190
We’re already studying that in-house.

00:08:16.190 --> 00:08:17.980
I’ll give you a report later.

00:08:17.980 --> 00:08:20.140
I see. I’m counting on you then.

00:08:20.140 --> 00:08:21.190
President.

00:08:21.190 --> 00:08:24.190
Excuse us. How are you feeling?

00:08:24.920 --> 00:08:27.800
Sorry, but can you please sign these documents?

00:08:27.800 --> 00:08:32.080
Also, I know this is a bad time, President, but we’ve got a pressing problem.

00:08:32.080 --> 00:08:35.530
Hey, wasn’t Dad under strict orders to get rest?

00:08:35.530 --> 00:08:39.100
But, Papa said to let his employees see him.

00:08:39.100 --> 00:08:42.570
He’ll never be able to recover like this.

00:08:42.570 --> 00:08:44.080
Yeah...

00:08:44.080 --> 00:08:49.010
Hey, Mama. Where were those documents that I was supposed to pass to Nishimura-san?

00:08:49.010 --> 00:08:52.370
I think the documents should be in the bag.

00:08:53.050 --> 00:08:54.410
Naoki-san.

00:08:55.220 --> 00:08:58.600
Excuse me, but I’d like to speak with you.

00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:02.420
Good afternoon!

00:09:04.500 --> 00:09:06.090
Ah, Kotoko-chan.

00:09:06.660 --> 00:09:07.760
Good afternoon.

00:09:07.760 --> 00:09:09.730
Onii-chan isn’t here.

00:09:09.730 --> 00:09:10.870
That wasn’t my intention...

00:09:10.870 --> 00:09:12.690
There’s no place for you to sit either.

00:09:12.690 --> 00:09:14.700
Hey! Yuuki!

00:09:14.700 --> 00:09:16.630
Are those people from Oji-sama’s company?

00:09:16.630 --> 00:09:18.450
Yeah, they are.

00:09:20.880 --> 00:09:24.620
Oh right! Visiting hours are almost over.

00:09:24.620 --> 00:09:28.010
So, why don’t you go downstairs for some tea until then?

00:09:28.010 --> 00:09:29.680
I’ll do that then.

00:09:29.680 --> 00:09:31.420
I’ll go too then.

00:09:31.420 --> 00:09:33.320
Okay, let’s go.

00:09:34.950 --> 00:09:35.920
Naoki-san.

00:09:35.920 --> 00:09:41.360
You’re acquainted with Sir Robbins, the president of the bank that our company is dealing with, correct?

00:09:41.360 --> 00:09:46.130
Yes, I’ve greeted him once last year at a celebration party.

00:09:46.130 --> 00:09:51.020
Well, Sir Robbins is very interested in you.

00:09:51.020 --> 00:09:54.940
He’d like to introduce his daughter to you.

00:09:54.940 --> 00:09:57.920
Is it... a marriage interview?

00:09:57.920 --> 00:10:00.920
Well, umm...

00:10:01.980 --> 00:10:05.090
There are serious doubts about the credibility of our management.

00:10:05.090 --> 00:10:07.920
Because of the president’s heart attack...

00:10:07.920 --> 00:10:11.680
...the loan negotiations with the other party are in jeopardy.

00:10:12.260 --> 00:10:17.060
In short, this is something that would benefit the management of the company?

00:10:17.060 --> 00:10:18.590
Yes.

00:10:18.590 --> 00:10:23.560
If possible, could you please attend a company luncheon just once?

00:10:25.600 --> 00:10:28.310
Very well, I will meet her.

00:10:28.870 --> 00:10:32.310
How could you? Irie-kun...

00:10:39.700 --> 00:10:41.530
Marriage interview?!

00:10:41.530 --> 00:10:42.700
Irie is?!

00:10:47.480 --> 00:10:48.420
And?

00:10:48.420 --> 00:10:52.870
He’s going to meet her this Sunday for the sake of meeting her.

00:10:52.870 --> 00:10:54.570
And, what are you going to do?

00:10:56.130 --> 00:10:58.930
Matsumoto-san? There’s nothing I can...

00:10:58.930 --> 00:11:00.770
You’re not acting like yourself!

00:11:03.070 --> 00:11:04.390
All right then!

00:11:12.200 --> 00:11:15.240
Why do I have to wear these clothes too?

00:11:15.240 --> 00:11:20.620
Because this is the least suspicious clothing for infiltrating the garden!

00:11:21.610 --> 00:11:25.250
Irie-kun sure looks really cool in a suit.

00:11:25.700 --> 00:11:26.920
You’re really...

00:11:26.920 --> 00:11:28.580
Come on, look!

00:11:28.580 --> 00:11:30.510
Oh, be quiet. I’m looking.

00:11:31.840 --> 00:11:34.000
The girl is coming.

00:11:49.280 --> 00:11:51.270
Too dazzling!

00:11:52.960 --> 00:11:55.030
She’s not that great.

00:12:06.420 --> 00:12:09.190
I can’t understand what they’re saying at all!

00:12:09.190 --> 00:12:12.790
They’re conversing in English.
Obviously, you wouldn’t understand.

00:12:12.790 --> 00:12:15.000
Could that be...?

00:12:15.000 --> 00:12:16.700
The preparations are perfect.

00:12:16.700 --> 00:12:18.400
As expected of the Science Department.

00:12:18.400 --> 00:12:20.520
So, what are they saying?

00:12:20.520 --> 00:12:23.630
Let’s see, like she has royal blood...

00:12:23.630 --> 00:12:24.850
Royal?!

00:12:24.850 --> 00:12:27.730
And like her mother is a Hollywood actress.

00:12:27.730 --> 00:12:28.810
Actress?

00:12:28.810 --> 00:12:31.710
Wow, she’s a celebrity.

00:12:31.710 --> 00:12:33.570
And, what else?

00:12:33.570 --> 00:12:35.990
The rest is mostly just what you’re seeing.

00:12:35.990 --> 00:12:39.900
He’s definitely trying to leave a good impression.

00:12:39.900 --> 00:12:41.610
As expected of Irie-kun.

00:12:41.610 --> 00:12:45.250
I really admire your positiveness.

00:12:45.250 --> 00:12:47.520
Look out, they’re coming outside.

00:12:47.520 --> 00:12:48.430
What are you gonna do?

00:12:48.430 --> 00:12:49.920
Just leave it to me!

00:12:51.690 --> 00:12:55.550
I only know a little Japanese.

00:13:08.890 --> 00:13:13.720
Aren’t they hitting it off a little too well?!

00:13:13.720 --> 00:13:15.280
What are you doing?

00:13:15.280 --> 00:13:17.290
I gonna drench her with this!

00:13:23.470 --> 00:13:24.600
That’s strange...

00:13:34.160 --> 00:13:35.410
Why you...

00:13:35.410 --> 00:13:36.960
Sorry...

00:13:36.960 --> 00:13:39.320
I’m such a fool for expecting anything from you.

00:13:39.320 --> 00:13:42.580
It’ll be all right this time. Just you wait!

00:13:43.150 --> 00:13:44.920
Look at this.

00:13:47.470 --> 00:13:49.140
What do you intend to do with that?

00:13:49.140 --> 00:13:52.640
I’m gonna throw it at her once they cross over the top of that bridge.

00:13:52.640 --> 00:13:53.570
Then?

00:13:54.820 --> 00:13:57.210
Then she’s gonna have a fright and fall into the pond.

00:13:57.210 --> 00:13:59.220
Isn’t this a childish prank?

00:13:59.220 --> 00:14:00.550
Is it too much?

00:14:00.550 --> 00:14:02.650
Not a problem.

00:14:02.650 --> 00:14:04.190
Here they come!

00:14:12.340 --> 00:14:13.710
They stopped.

00:14:14.650 --> 00:14:15.830
A chance!

00:14:15.830 --> 00:14:18.260
I won’t fail this time!

00:14:34.450 --> 00:14:35.660
No way...

00:14:40.070 --> 00:14:41.800
Hey, don’t push!

00:15:01.750 --> 00:15:03.680
Thank you for your hospitality today.

00:15:05.540 --> 00:15:06.600
Yes.

00:15:07.850 --> 00:15:09.630
Yes, please go ahead with it.

00:15:12.440 --> 00:15:13.230
Hey!

00:15:13.230 --> 00:15:14.490
Yes?

00:15:14.490 --> 00:15:17.350
Where did you get those clothes?

00:15:18.090 --> 00:15:20.730
Well, uh...

00:15:26.400 --> 00:15:28.470
Hey, Irie-kun!

00:15:28.470 --> 00:15:29.320
What is it?

00:15:33.980 --> 00:15:35.830
Are you going to marry her?

00:15:37.770 --> 00:15:39.210
I might.

00:15:41.040 --> 00:15:43.110
What should I do?

00:15:43.110 --> 00:15:45.790
Irie-kun will be leaving.

00:15:54.800 --> 00:15:57.790
Your father’s condition is very poor.

00:15:57.790 --> 00:16:01.620
What’s needed most is to remove his stress.

00:16:11.480 --> 00:16:13.980
Your usual gang isn’t with you?

00:16:20.500 --> 00:16:22.280
I see.

00:16:22.280 --> 00:16:24.540
So, it’s progressing?

00:16:28.010 --> 00:16:31.420
If someone was going to steal
Irie-kun from me...

00:16:31.420 --> 00:16:33.640
...I’d still prefer it to be you.

00:16:34.640 --> 00:16:37.030
Doesn’t it just make you angry?

00:16:37.030 --> 00:16:40.520
For a perfect person to come out of nowhere and take him away.

00:16:40.970 --> 00:16:47.380
On top of that, it feels like I’ve lost to that Chris girl without even getting a chance to fight.

00:16:48.060 --> 00:16:52.770
And that point; your dedication is the only thing I can’t help but approve.

00:16:56.140 --> 00:16:57.920
Honestly...

00:16:57.920 --> 00:17:01.490
We deserve to end up with broken hearts, don’t we?

00:17:03.380 --> 00:17:04.910
Broken hearts, huh?

00:17:05.750 --> 00:17:08.230
I guess I just have to admit defeat...

00:17:12.630 --> 00:17:13.880
Kin-chan?

00:17:20.100 --> 00:17:20.980
Good morning.

00:17:23.100 --> 00:17:24.650
You sure are late.

00:17:24.650 --> 00:17:26.100
Is bread okay?

00:17:26.100 --> 00:17:27.040
Where’s Kotoko?

00:17:27.040 --> 00:17:28.640
She said that she had a date.

00:17:28.640 --> 00:17:29.700
Her?

00:17:30.420 --> 00:17:31.360
With whom?

00:17:31.360 --> 00:17:34.410
No idea, I saw her all dressed up before leaving.

00:17:36.210 --> 00:17:38.990
Oh, there’s actually someone with such a fetish.

00:17:56.420 --> 00:17:58.890
A marriage interview?!

00:18:01.810 --> 00:18:05.640
Did you not hear it from Naoki-san?

00:18:05.640 --> 00:18:07.840
Kimura-san! What’s the meaning of this?!

00:18:08.560 --> 00:18:13.230
Sir Robbins requested him to take her out so that they could get married.

00:18:13.230 --> 00:18:14.900
Papa! You knew, didn’t you?!

00:18:15.840 --> 00:18:19.410
He’s going to see her today.

00:18:21.420 --> 00:18:26.670
However, President. If things go well between them, then the company’s future will...

00:19:03.830 --> 00:19:06.290
I’m stuffed.

00:19:06.290 --> 00:19:08.090
Of course you are.

00:19:08.090 --> 00:19:10.560
Even I haven’t eaten that much very often!

00:19:10.560 --> 00:19:12.000
But, it was fun.

00:19:12.000 --> 00:19:13.820
That’s good to hear.

00:19:13.820 --> 00:19:16.840
Smiling suits you best after all...

00:19:19.850 --> 00:19:22.180
What is it?

00:19:23.450 --> 00:19:24.680
Thanks.

00:19:24.680 --> 00:19:27.310
All I...

00:19:27.310 --> 00:19:29.930
...want is for you to smile.

00:19:39.220 --> 00:19:41.190
It was really wonderful.

00:19:41.190 --> 00:19:43.810
I’m happy that you enjoyed it.

00:19:50.100 --> 00:19:51.000
Hey.

00:19:54.120 --> 00:19:55.670
Hey, Mr. Genius.

00:19:55.670 --> 00:19:58.670
This is Christine Robbins.

00:20:00.190 --> 00:20:03.180
What a pretty young thing.

00:20:03.180 --> 00:20:06.560
This is my good friend from college,
Aihara-san.

00:20:06.560 --> 00:20:07.690
Nice to meet you.

00:20:07.690 --> 00:20:10.930
I’m Aihara Kotoko. Nice to meet you.

00:20:10.930 --> 00:20:13.310
And this is...

00:20:13.310 --> 00:20:15.150
...the worker from the cafeteria.

00:20:15.150 --> 00:20:20.360
Yep. I’m Ikezawa Kinnosuke.
Nice to meet ya.

00:20:20.360 --> 00:20:22.900
So, it’s Kotoko and Kinnosuke, right?

00:20:26.200 --> 00:20:27.790
Hey...

00:20:27.790 --> 00:20:29.880
Kin-chan, let’s go.

00:20:53.770 --> 00:20:57.440
Wow, the night view is real pretty, isn’t it, Kin-chan?

00:21:08.290 --> 00:21:10.680
Hey, Kotoko...

00:21:11.850 --> 00:21:13.140
What is it?

00:21:13.140 --> 00:21:15.830
I’ll never make you have that face.

00:21:16.830 --> 00:21:20.690
I’ll always make you smile.

00:21:21.290 --> 00:21:22.700
Kin-chan...

00:21:22.700 --> 00:21:24.340
So...

00:21:25.430 --> 00:21:27.590
Will you marry me?

00:23:07.720 --> 00:23:12.770
Kin-chan, marriage?
It’s too sudden. I can’t answer...

00:23:12.770 --> 00:23:13.560
I’m back.

00:23:14.660 --> 00:23:17.090
Irie-kun. You sure are late.

00:23:17.090 --> 00:23:19.000
Yeah, I guess.

00:23:19.330 --> 00:23:22.440
You two were getting along really well too.

00:23:23.950 --> 00:23:26.080
It’s not like that!

00:23:26.080 --> 00:23:28.670
Stupid Irie-kun.

00:23:28.670 --> 00:23:31.040
Next time on Itazura na Kiss:

00:23:31.040 --> 00:23:33.090
Period of love.

00:23:33.090 --> 00:23:35.210
I’m definitely gonna be happy.
